<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=13733</link>
<description> Shot off the Lancer, trained for it's ammo going down. Found it's var. Then just went through knobbling values around this until I found the one for this gun. Did the same for every gun.  Went to the shop after the 1st level, and bought a 'Chopper', whilst training for values that have changed from 0 to 1 (same as R&amp;C1), found a big table that has all the items, gadgets, weapons, so just worked out what byte is which item, and unlocked it.  Same method for all the items !  COPY PROTECTION METHOD:-  Even though these are just flags, and only need to be set to 1.. I decided to make them a counting scale, from 0x1 to 0x19.. It will be obvious if they're copied because no-one in their right mind would set flags in such a weird way.</description>
